    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like a lie. \"just existing\" sounds like a consolation prize for people who didn't make it. if you know you're never going to be great, why keep grinding through decades of just being \"fine\"? it feels like living a life that's basically already over, just waiting for the clock to run out.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
